# How to Apply the .gitignore File
# Create the file inside C:\Users\twan\Source\Repos\H3\Lagerstyringsprojekt\
# Run the following commands in Git Bash or PowerShell:
# git rm -r --cached .
# git add .
# git commit -m "Applied .gitignore to remove unnecessary files"
# git push origin YOUR_BRANCH_NAME

# This will:
# Remove unwanted files from Git tracking
# Keep them in your local project
# Prevent them from being committed again


